msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq-accordion-doodle.php:35
msgid "What makes LearnSchool different from other schools?"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq-accordion-doodle.php:36
msgid "We blend research-backed Montessori manipulatives with small 1:4 to 1:10 educator pods, organic daily meals, and joyful outdoor discovery."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq-accordion-doodle.php:41
msgid "How can parents check daily updates and enrollment availability?"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq-accordion-doodle.php:42
msgid "Enrolled families receive real-time photo journals and milestone updates in the Parent Portal, and prospective families can schedule a campus tour anytime."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq-accordion-doodle.php:47
msgid "What about campus safety, allergies, and student privacy?"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq-accordion-doodle.php:48
msgid "Our campus is 100% nut-free with CPR-certified staff, keypad-secured entry, and strict family-only photo sharing inside our encrypted Parent Portal."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq-accordion.php
msgctxt "Pattern title"
msgid "Parent Handbook & FAQ Accordion (Zero-JS)"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq-accordion.php
msgctxt "Pattern description"
msgid "Zero-JS expandable accordion built with native core/details blocks for parent questions."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq-accordion.php:23
msgid "Frequently Asked "
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq-accordion.php:23
msgid "Parent Questions"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq-accordion.php:27
msgid "Clear answers on health, safety, tuition, and classroom routines."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq-accordion.php:33
msgid "What are your student-to-teacher ratios in each classroom?"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq-accordion.php:34
msgid "We strictly adhere to and exceed state licensing standards. Our Infant room is maintained at 1:4, Toddlers at 1:6, Preschool at 1:10, and Pre-K at 1:12. Every lead educator is backed by a certified co-teacher."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq-accordion.php:39
msgid "How do you handle food allergies and dietary preferences?"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq-accordion.php:40
msgid "Our entire school campus is 100% nut-free. Our on-site chef prepares organic, non-GMO warm meals daily and accommodates gluten-free, dairy-free, vegetarian, and individualized medical allergy plans."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq-accordion.php:45
msgid "What is your diapering and potty training philosophy?"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq-accordion.php:46
msgid "Children do not need to be potty trained to enroll in our Toddler or Preschool rooms. We partner with parents through positive reinforcement and gentle bathroom routines when your child demonstrates readiness cues."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq-accordion.php:51
msgid "What is your health and immunization safety policy?"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq-accordion.php:52
msgid "To ensure community safety, all enrolled children must provide up-to-date state health department immunization records or an official medical exemption before their first day on campus."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq-accordion.php:57
msgid "How does your waitlist work and do you offer sibling discounts?"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq-accordion.php:58
msgid "Waitlist priority is determined by application date, with priority placement given to currently enrolled families. We offer a 10% tuition discount for the second enrolled sibling."
msgstr ""

